  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "The two runs that can falsify the rest: one with an experimental structure to check against, one with no ligand at all.",
   "zh": "能夠推翻其餘結果的兩條軌跡：一條有實驗結構可以對照，一條完全沒有配體。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "The same pose with the N-terminus deleted in stages, headed by the full-length reference. The ladder is not monotonic.",
   "zh": "同一個結合姿態，N 端分階段刪去，最上面是全長的參考狀態。這道梯子不是單調的。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Six histidines fused after Asn23, which changes what the acceptance criterion is measuring.",
   "zh": "在 Asn23 之後接上六個組胺酸，這改變了驗收標準實際量到的東西。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Three histidines switched to their protonated form for the apoplast, with no other atom touched.",
   "zh": "為了模擬質外體，把三個組胺酸換成質子化形式，其餘原子一個都沒動。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "AtPep1 7-23 benchmark",
   "zh": "AtPep1 7-23 基準"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "The peptide actually resolved in the 5GR8 crystal structure, run under settings identical to the other eight. It is the only system with an experimental structure to check against, so it sets the scale the rest are read on.",
   "zh": "5GR8 晶體結構中真正解出的胜肽，以與其餘八條軌跡完全相同的參數執行。全套之中只有它有實驗結構可以對照，因此它定下了其他頁面被閱讀時的尺度。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "No peptide",
   "zh": "無胜肽"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Receptor alone (apo)",
   "zh": "受體單獨（apo）"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Negative control",
   "zh": "陰性對照"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "The peptide removed entirely. The receptor is no looser, the groove does not collapse, and the per-residue flexibility profile barely moves. That puts a measured floor under every receptor-side number on the other eight pages.",
   "zh": "把胜肽整個移除。受體並沒有變鬆，凹槽沒有塌陷，逐殘基柔性分布幾乎不動。這替另外八頁所有受體端的數字量出了一條雜訊底線。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "BoPep4 wild type 1-23",
   "zh": "BoPep4 野生型 1-23"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Reference state",
   "zh": "參考狀態"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "The complete mature sequence with a free C-terminus. The other seven BoPep4 trajectories are all read against this one.",
   "zh": "完整的成熟序列，C 端為自由羧基。其餘七條 BoPep4 軌跡都是對照這一條來讀的。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Hypothesis falsified",
   "zh": "假設被推翻"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "把 Lys7 與 Lys8 加回 9-23 之後，鉗合恢復。原因不是自由 N 端的假影消失，而是 Lys7 抓住了 Asp129，而這條鹽橋並不在 Tang 的八個熱點名單上。這也是第一個能與基準逐殘基對比的構築。",
   "zh": ""
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "The construct that was ordered",
   "zh": "已下單的構築"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Deleting residues 1-8 loosens the anchor at the far end of the peptide. The clamp flickers open 94 times in 30 ns, none of the gaps longer than 0.68 ns.",
   "zh": "刪掉殘基 1-8 之後，鬆掉的是胜肽另一端的錨。鉗合在 30 奈秒內斷開 94 次，沒有一次超過 0.68 奈秒。"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Control that did not fail",
   "zh": "沒有失敗的對照"
  },
  {
   "src": "runs.js",
   "en": "Planned as a negative control that would fall off and supply a leaving time. It did not fall off, and it could not have: unbinding runs on microseconds to milliseconds, three to six orders of magnitude past 30 ns.",
   "zh": "原本設計成會脫落、可以量出離開時間的陰性對照。它沒有脫落，而且本來就不可能：解離發生在微秒到毫秒尺度，比 30 奈秒長三到六個數量級。"
  },
  {
